"""
smartctltui is a terminal (curses) front-end for smartmontools' smartctl,
modelled on GSmartControl. Pick a drive, then browse General, Attributes,
Statistics, Self-Tests, Error Log, Temperature, Advanced and Raw views,
start or abort self-tests, and save any report to disk.

Navigate with vim-style h/l (tabs), j/k/gg/G (scroll), Enter to open a drive,
t for tests, s to save, r to refresh, ? for help.
"""

